# Leonin Arbiter: "Players can't search libraries" (AddKeyword$ CantSearchLibrary,
# Player.canSearchLibraryWith, Player.java:3754). Rampant Growth's search
# offers nothing from the library (ChangeZoneEffect.java:1032-1038), so the
# Forest stays put: no card choice is queued, and one would fail the run.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 G
tapformana human 2 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 3
resolvestack
